WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:02.080
SCP-682 VS D-3654.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.000
Could a D-Class with an equally pessimistic
and misanthropic worldview as SCP-682 make

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.210
the perfect pacifying playmate?

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.630
The Foundation decided to send in the most
hateful D-Class they could find to have a

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.350
chat with SCP-682.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:22.050
Strangely, 682 never tried to kill this D-Class,
they instead just chatted for a few minutes

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:27.360
about their incredibly low opinions on humanity,
while researchers listened from the sidelines.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:33.160
Turns out that 682’s takes were too spicy
for even D-3654, as after under five minutes

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.790
of listening to 682 ranting, he slipped into
a catatonic state and died.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:42.290
The researchers who were listening in also
needed to be treated for severe, violent depression.

